    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "如果把「支持向量机」拆开来看，真正改变研究方向的部分是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "20 世纪 90 年代初，机器学习需要能在有限数据上泛化并具有清晰数学保证的方法。SVM 将 VC 式容量控制转化为实用分类器。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-a-training-algorithm-for-optimal-margin-classifiers"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "SVM 偏好不只是训练集正确、而且离最近样本足够远的边界。核函数让非线性边界成为可能，同时保留凸优化问题。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-a-training-algorithm-for-optimal-margin-classifiers"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 SVM 视为成熟的经典方法，其概念重要性超过了它在多数现代深度学习流水线中的实际角色。它的长期影响在于用间隔和核方法理解泛化、稳健边界和非线性分类。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-a-training-algorithm-for-optimal-margin-classifiers"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
